{'symbol': 'BRO', 'date': '2021-07-14 12:00:00', 'title': 'PILLARRX CONSULTING, LLC HIRES KELLY TANNER, DIRECTOR OF AUDITING', 'text': 'MILWAUKEE, JULY 14, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- AS THE DIRECTOR OF AUDITING, KELLY TANNER\xa0(CPHT) BRINGS OVER 30 YEARS OF EXPERIENCE IN VARIOUS ROLES OF THE PHARMACY INDUSTRY, INCLUDING 16 YEARS OF DIRECT PBM EXPERIENCE.\xa0 KELLY HAS DIRECT EXPERIENCE IN ANALYTICS, IT DEVELOPMENT, PROJECT MANAGEMENT, DATA VALIDATION, AND IS WIDELY RECOGNIZED AS AN EXPERT IN PHARMACY DATA PROCESSING \xa0AND OVERALL PBM UNDERSTANDING.'}